    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Epilogue - Promises (Adora's POV)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Two years have passed since Adora and Catra found Halfmoon and Catra officially proposed to Adora. They've created their own home, had many great adventures together... and today is finally the big day. IT'S THEIR WEDDING DAY!!! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These two lovebirds finally get to celebrate their official union as wives. As the day progresses, all share many special, memorable moment's together both past and present. The next chapter of their lives is about to be written.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
